o resort and I just talked to a travel agent. Do you mind sharing how you found your local (mexico) travel agent? by the way...it will be one year this december of us being engaged :lol:  \u200b&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1915699,"PostDate":1474336705,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>hi! We are planning for a feb. 2018 wedding. Still no resort and I just talked to a travel agent. Do you mind sharing how you found your local (mexico) travel agent? by the way...it will be one year this december of us being engaged <img src='https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/laugh.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':lol:' \/>\u00a0\u00a0\u200b<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"yazil1304@gmail.com","IpAddress":"75.171.71.115","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1474227573,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-287765.jpg?_r=1474333958","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"phoenixbride","Id":287765,"Name":"phoenixbride","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":21,"TotalPages":3,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":10,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":20},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
