array (
  '/REST/Forums/topic/newTopic?SessionId' => '420b5fd49894b1753a7dcd4f81ef775c',
  'module' => 'REST',
  'section' => 'run',
  'request_method' => 'post',
  'app' => 'REST_Service',
  'application' => 'Forums',
  'class' => 'topic',
  'operation' => 'newTopic',
  'SessionId' => '420b5fd49894b1753a7dcd4f81ef775c',
  'forumId' => '14',
  'title' => 'Finally Planning!',
  'postContent' => 'Hello Ladies and Gents!

I\'ve been engaged for 4 years now and have always been discouraged when beginning to plan our wedding as I find no enthusiasm from the OH. However, I recently landed a job as a travel agent and now feel the excitement in planning a destination wedding!

We\'ve found the destination and resort we love but have some questions regarding the photography side of things? Do you take a photographer with you, or find one out there? I don\'t understand how it works 😁.

We decided to start our family a few years ago and now have a beautiful little boy and we\'d still like another to complete our family before getting married, so fingers crossed it happens ASAP! 😂.

Any other destination brides/grooms that are taking their young ones?',
  'follow' => 'False',
  'sessionId' => '420b5fd49894b1753a7dcd4f81ef775c',
)
